    "bottomwear (full:bottomwear): its art starts 181.0 px below chest's origin, so it hangs from the waist — its mesh takes the hip line and its skirt chains, no chest segment, and the breath does not carry its root",
    "bottomwear (bottomwear): config.cloth.\"bottomwear\" -> 4 tree(s) on one shared swing, skirt_swing (each tree's first link takes its rotation times 1.3/1/1/1.3, its setup rotation -90 degrees subtracted) from hip, rooted 20 px below its y and tipped 4 px above bottomwear's bottom, laid down the screen, a 1-link trunk forking into 2 branches, 3 links root to tip (skirt0_, skirt0a_, skirt0b_, skirt1_, skirt1a_, skirt1b_, skirt2_, skirt2a_, skirt2b_, skirt3_, skirt3a_, skirt3b_); 29 constraint(s), physics on every link, wind 2 -> 10 and gravity 5 -> 30 root to tip (multipliers of the consumer's environment; no direction is drafted), no idle key; the recipe's own defaults, measured on its synthetic fixture (AUTHORING §3): length_ratio 0.5, strength 100/100/50",
